---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '~/components/layout/Section.astro';
import Container from '~/components/layout/Container.astro';
import Heading from '~/components/primitives/Heading.astro';
import Text from '~/components/primitives/Text.astro';
import Link from '~/components/primitives/Link.astro';

const updated = 'June 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy | Joshua Briley"
  description="What I collect when you contact me, how it's used, and how to ask for it to be removed."
>
  <Section tone="paper" padding="default">
    <Container width="narrow">
      <p class="calm-label">Legal · Last updated {updated}</p>

      <Heading level={1} visual="display-lg" class="mt-5">Privacy policy</Heading>
      <Text size="lg" tone="muted" class="mt-6 max-w-2xl">
        Plain version: I only collect what you send me, I use it to reply, and I don't sell it. The
        detail is below.
      </Text>

      <div class="legal mt-12 space-y-12">
        <section>
          <Heading level={2} visual="h2" class="mb-4">What I collect</Heading>
          <p>
            When you fill out the contact form I receive what you choose to enter: your name, email
            address, an optional phone number, the type of work you're interested in, and your
            message. I don't ask for anything I don't need to reply.
          </p>
          <p>
            Like any website, the hosting platform records standard technical logs (IP address,
            browser type, and the pages requested) used to keep the site running and secure.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <Heading level={2} visual="h2" class="mb-4">Who processes it</Heading>
          <p>A few third parties handle data on my behalf, each under their own privacy terms:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>HubSpot</strong> receives contact-form
              submissions and stores them so I can manage and respond to inquiries.</li>
            <li><strong>Netlify</strong> hosts the site and keeps
              the server logs described above.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <Heading level={2} visual="h2" class="mb-4">How it's used</Heading>
          <p>
            I use your information for one thing: to read your message and reply about the work
            you're asking about. I don't sell it, rent it, or share it for advertising. I won't add
            you to a marketing list without you asking.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <Heading level={2} visual="h2" class="mb-4">Cookies</Heading>
          <p>
            The site itself doesn't set tracking or advertising cookies. The embedded HubSpot form
            and Calendly scheduler may set their own cookies when you interact with them; those are
            governed by their respective policies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <Heading level={2} visual="h2" class="mb-4">Keeping and removing your data</Heading>
          <p>
            I keep contact-form messages for as long as they're useful to our correspondence. You can
            ask me to show you what I have, correct it, or delete it at any time. Just email
            <Link href="mailto:josh@thebrileys.com" variant="inline">josh@thebrileys.com</Link> and
            I'll take care of it.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <Heading level={2} visual="h2" class="mb-4">Changes</Heading>
          <p>
            If this policy changes, the "last updated" date above changes with it. Questions about
            any of this are welcome at
            <Link href="mailto:josh@thebrileys.com" variant="inline">josh@thebrileys.com</Link>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12">
        <Link href="/" variant="arrow">Back to home</Link>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal p {
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }
  .legal p + p {
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
  }
  .legal ul {
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }
  .legal li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .legal li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.7em;
    height: 4px;
    width: 4px;
    border-radius: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .legal strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
